WEBVTT

00:11:29.143 --> 00:11:31.645
but we do not have equity.

00:11:32.104 --> 00:11:33.772
It is not a level playing field.

00:11:33.814 --> 00:11:35.232
It never has been.

00:11:36.191 --> 00:11:39.945
You can be a part of the solution
by elevating us to equal footing.

00:11:39.987 --> 00:11:42.156
You uniquely have that power.

00:11:44.158 --> 00:11:46.034
And to all of us,

00:11:46.034 --> 00:11:47.953
do you know who I think about a lot?

00:11:49.413 --> 00:11:51.749
I think about my brown-skinned daughter.

00:11:53.041 --> 00:11:55.335
And my brown-skinned daughter-in-law.

00:11:55.335 --> 00:11:57.713
What do they know that I’m clueless about?

00:11:57.755 --> 00:11:59.882
What do any of us really know

00:11:59.882 --> 00:12:02.426
about the shoes in which
we have never walked?